    "batch": "bulk-2026-10",
    "method": "Every original English and Chinese line is retained in a display-only paired order. Original publisher practice notes establish ordered audio sampling windows; they do not establish exact lyric onsets or four-path musical agreement. Two pinned canonical contextual windows supply early reading guides. Four explicitly reviewed clipped prefixes use agreeing word ends and at least four following contextual word edges; literal recognition of these words is not claimed. Nonadjacent jumps additionally require unique original prefixes in two independent prompt-free full-recording transcripts with agreeing first-word edges. Five-screen browser checks retain both languages of adjacent readings before and after each move and exercise every actual seek. Initial reading is shown from zero; these are reading previews, not claimed exact sung onsets.",
    "performanceOrder": [
      {
        "region": "b0_l0",
        "text": "Lamb of God—our dear Redeeming One is Christ!",
        "label": "原文第1段第1行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b0_l1",
        "text": "For our sins He paid the highest price",
        "label": "原文第1段第2行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b0_l2",
        "text": "To redeem and to recover us",
        "label": "原文第1段第3行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b0_l3",
        "text": "Who were lost and fallen far from God.",
        "label": "原文第1段第4行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b0_l4",
        "text": "As the Lamb, He had no blemish;",
        "label": "原文第1段第5行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b0_l5",
        "text": "He was meek, even submissive.",
        "label": "原文第1段第6行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b0_l6",
        "text": "How can we like Him obedient be",
        "label": "原文第1段第7行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b0_l7",
        "text": "Unto death, that even of the cross?",
        "label": "原文第1段第8行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b1_l0",
        "text": "I want to follow Him,",
        "label": "原文第2段第1行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b1_l1",
        "text": "Rest from all my wandering,",
        "label": "原文第2段第2行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b1_l2",
        "text": "End all my endeavoring;",
        "label": "原文第2段第3行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b1_l3",
        "text": "Even though I know not where or",
        "label": "原文第2段第4行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b1_l4",
        "text": "How—I know He cares!",
        "label": "原文第2段第5行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b1_l5",
        "text": "I know He'll never err; I know He'll lead me well.",
        "label": "原文第2段第6行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b1_l6",
        "text": "I know His voice; this now my choice—",
        "label": "原文第2段第7行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b1_l7",
        "text": "Follow where the Lamb would lead.",
        "label": "原文第2段第8行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b2_l0",
        "text": "When He came, though many followed in the way,",
        "label": "原文第3段第1行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b2_l1",
        "text": "Few remained who knew Him and His ways.",
        "label": "原文第3段第2行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b2_l2",
        "text": "Lamb of God—He took the narrow gate;",
        "label": "原文第3段第3行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b2_l3",
        "text": "The constricted way to life He traced;",
        "label": "原文第3段第4行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b2_l4",
        "text": "Sacrificed, though men denied Him;",
        "label": "原文第3段第5行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b2_l5",
        "text": "Gave His life, though men forsook Him.",
        "label": "原文第3段第6行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b2_l6",
        "text": "How can we t'ward Him still hardened be",
        "label": "原文第3段第7行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b2_l7",
        "text": "When to us He gave all selflessly?",
        "label": "原文第3段第8行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b1_l0",
        "text": "I want to follow Him,",
        "label": "原文第2段第1行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b1_l1",
        "text": "Rest from all my wandering,",
        "label": "原文第2段第2行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b1_l2",
        "text": "End all my endeavoring;",
        "label": "原文第2段第3行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b1_l3",
        "text": "Even though I know not where or",
        "label": "原文第2段第4行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b1_l4",
        "text": "How—I know He cares!",
        "label": "原文第2段第5行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b1_l5",
        "text": "I know He'll never err; I know He'll lead me well.",
        "label": "原文第2段第6行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b1_l6",
        "text": "I know His voice; this now my choice—",
        "label": "原文第2段第7行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b1_l7",
        "text": "Follow where the Lamb would lead.",
        "label": "原文第2段第8行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b3_l0",
        "text": "Lord we pray, preserve us faithful in the way",
        "label": "原文第4段第1行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b3_l1",
        "text": "All our days, never to fall away.",
        "label": "原文第4段第2行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b3_l2",
        "text": "By Your grace, keep us pursuing You,",
        "label": "原文第4段第3行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b3_l3",
        "text": "Taking up the cross to follow You.",
        "label": "原文第4段第4行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b3_l4",
        "text": "Consecrate we unreservedly,",
        "label": "原文第4段第5行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b3_l5",
        "text": "Absolute for You entirely.",
        "label": "原文第4段第6行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b3_l6",
        "text": "In our hearts, Lord, let the highways be",
        "label": "原文第4段第7行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b3_l7",
        "text": "Unto Zion single-heartedly.",
        "label": "原文第4段第8行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b4_l0",
        "text": "Now we will follow Him!",
        "label": "原文第5段第1行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b4_l1",
        "text": "To His call we're answering,",
        "label": "原文第5段第2行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b4_l2",
        "text": "All we are we're offering.",
        "label": "原文第5段第3行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b4_l3",
        "text": "New Jerusalem we see",
        "label": "原文第5段第4行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b4_l4",
        "text": "Come down from heav'n to earth!",
        "label": "原文第5段第5行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b4_l5",
        "text": "God and man mingled now, our oneness we avow",
        "label": "原文第5段第6行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b4_l6",
        "text": "Eternally, O gloriously!",
        "label": "原文第5段第7行"
      },
      {
        "region": "b4_l7",
        "text": "This is where the Lamb would lead!",
        "label": "原文第5段第8行"
      }
    ],
